🐧 Linux Basic Commands Cheat Sheet
===================================

📌 Commands
-----------
ls        ---> show files and folders in current directory
cd folder ---> go inside a folder
cd ..     ---> go one step back
pwd       ---> show current directory (where you are)
whoami    ---> show current user
cat file  ---> read/open a file

-------------------------------

🧠 Example Usage
---------------
ls
# output: folder1 folder2 file.txt

cd folder1
# go inside folder1

cd ..
# go back

cat file.txt
# read file content

-------------------------------

⚡ Ultra Short Memory Version
----------------------------
ls = list
cd = change directory
pwd = where am I
whoami = user
cat = read file
cd .. = back

-------------------------------

🚀 Goal
-------
Practice daily until commands feel natural (no thinking needed)
